The '''dense essence mine''' is located north-east of [[Arceuus]]. Overseen by [[Clerris]], the mine contains two [[dense runestone]]s, where players can mine [[dense essence block]]s, which are then used on the [[Dark Altar]] to create [[dark essence block]]s.

In order to use this mine, players require level 38 [[Mining]] and 38 [[Crafting]]. A [[pickaxe]] and [[chisel]] in the player's inventory is required to mine the dense runestone, granting 12 Mining and 8 Crafting experience per block mined. It is not possible to get a [[rock golem]] pet from mining here.{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/761138207593533440|date=4 August 2016|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/97794|archivedate=13 April 2020|quote=Nope.}}

After completion of the medium tasks in the [[Kourend & Kebos Diary]], players have a chance to mine two dense essence blocks at once. No additional experience is awarded for the extra block.

While only 38 Mining is required to mine the essence, a higher Mining level is slightly helpful, as the essence stone depletes less frequently with a higher Mining level.{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/973319634421239808|date=13 March 2018|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/101743|archivedate=25 May 2020|quote=Yes, slightly.}} At level 38 Mining there is a 85% chance to not deplete the dense runestone when successfully mining a dense essence block, increasing to 90% at level 99.{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/1057703180816080896|date=31 October 2018|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/106193|archivedate=25 May 2020|quote=82% -> 90% from 1 to 99}}

In order to use the shortcuts leading to and from the mine, players need to have 73 [[Agility]] for the [[Rocks (dense essence mine, west)|western rock scramble]], 69 for the [[Rocks (dense essence mine, north)|northern scramble]] and 52 for the [[Rocks (dense essence mine, east)|eastern scramble]]. A [[Boulder (dense essence mine)|boulder]] a little further to the north-east meanwhile requires 49 Agility to jump over.

